sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant PodSandboxManager
    participant RuntimeServiceStub
    participant ImageServiceStub

    User ->> PodSandboxManager: Start stateful pod
    PodSandboxManager ->> RuntimeServiceStub: RunPodSandbox (Create pod sandbox)
    RuntimeServiceStub -->> PodSandboxManager: PodSandboxID

    PodSandboxManager ->> ImageServiceStub: PullImage (busybox:latest)
    ImageServiceStub -->> PodSandboxManager: Image pulled

    PodSandboxManager ->> RuntimeServiceStub: CreateContainer (Stateful config)
    RuntimeServiceStub -->> PodSandboxManager: ContainerID

    PodSandboxManager ->> RuntimeServiceStub: StartContainer (ContainerID)
    RuntimeServiceStub -->> PodSandboxManager: Container started

    PodSandboxManager ->> User: Return PodSandboxID and ContainerID
